          [
            rule_section(:goal, "The game",
              "Audio Ball is a two-player game of listening and reacting. Send the ball to your opponent, then listen for the return and choose the right defence. A successful block leaves the ball with you, ready for your next shot. Let it past and your opponent scores. You can play against another person or a bot.",
              "Headphones help you follow the ball. With the default listening position, you are on the right: an incoming ball moves towards your right ear, while your own shot travels away to the left."),
